<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities GmbH, Frankfurt has issued six million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom, lead manager Schweizerische Bankgesellschaft (Deutschland) said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	    STRIKE	    ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A		30.00 DEM	 5.25 DEM</p>
<p> PUT B		 30.00 DEM	 2.64 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C		33.00 DEM	 3.64 DEM</p>
<p> PUT D		 33.00 DEM	 4.06 DEM</p>
<p> CALL E		36.00 DEM	 2.41 DEM</p>
<p> PUT F		 36.00 DEM	 5.85 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.NOV.96-01.DEC.98   PAYDATE	27.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  32.50 DEM</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
